{"tag_name":"v0.2.1","name":"Eden v0.2.1","html_url":"https://git.eden-emu.dev/eden-emu/eden/releases/tag/v0.2.1","body":"This is a hotfix release for 0.2.0, addressing some crashes and bugs that occurred in certain situations. CPU and graphics performance will remain largely the same.\n\nThis release does *not* use SDL3, and remains on SDL2.\n\n# Universal\n\n- The Windows auto updater now accounts for the current build ID and will properly fetch the corresponding build to your currently installed Eden\n- Fixed crashes and errors that could occur when large amounts of games and external content files were present\n- Fixed crashes on 12th-gen Intel CPUs\n- Fixed MK8DX freeze when the native controller applet was used\n- Fixed a rare case of weird noises playing on shutdown\n- Fixed mods that expect a real value out of `DefaultDataSpace`\n- Fixed some minor issues with emulated controller thread contention\n\n# Internal\n\n- Fixed several build errors:\n  - Newer Xbyak removed Xeon Phi features\n  - Unused variable errors in NCE\n  - Removed `httplib` version restrictions","created_at":"2026-09-13T01:28:05-04:00","published_at":"2026-09-13T01:28:05-04:00","assets":[{"name":"Eden-Android-v0.2.1-chromeos.apk","size":25586184,"digest":"sha256:554353f78e39bb486fa92c7524c2ca21890cd74b04ba6ef45f0f57b6683af6cc","created_at":"2026-09-13T01:28:04-04:00","browser_download_url":"https://stable.eden-emu.dev/v0.2.1/Eden-Android-v0.2.1-chromeos.apk"},{"name":"Eden-Android-v0.2.1-legacy.apk","size":25256955,"digest":"sha256:d7239e7fbe5e4e97a76892ef003312bec18ceccd14fa41aab26a99c68169f3b8","created_at":"2026-09-13T01:28:04-04:00","browser_download_url":"https://stable.eden-emu.dev/v0.2.1/Eden-Android-v0.2.1-legacy.apk"},{"name":"Eden-Android-v0.2.1-optimized.apk","size":24970679,"digest":"sha256:27d76e3f4a9fb35825bdbd4343f957aef26cf38e4ef008e190f2602922ca4586","created_at":"2026-09-13T01:28:04-04:00","browser_download_url":"https://stable.eden-emu.dev/v0.2.1/Eden-Android-v0.2.1-opti